ent and faces limited outside support.\n\nExpert raters mostly call the race Likely or Safe Democratic, and prediction markets price Ossoff's chances at 93 to 96 percent. Former President Trump plans a Georgia rally to boost Collins, which could energize Republican turnout, but the evidence points to a clear Ossoff advantage heading into the final weeks.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9499, "margin": 8.78}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9449, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9229, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9348, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9317, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9355, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9397, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9457, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9522, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9495, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9478, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9479, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9545, "margin": 8.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.928, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9516, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9505, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9677, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9512, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9398, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9584, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9603, "margin": 9.0}]}